        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105274?u=173310b843e2751843265438af8cfb79eda02039&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">In the 144 and 145 release notes:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Adds MathML section</li>\n<li>Combines HTML, MathML, and SVG</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">To normalize MathML’s location in the release notes and combine markup languages.</p>",
