        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47647?u=2fbfc431a85d357f00c0146d5e55b425b7f00a3d&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR is part of a series in which I update the Learn area \"Challenge\" articles. In general, they need to be modernized, restructured, and put in better positions in the modules so they are spaced out better and test subjects that have already been covered.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR specifically updates the <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Learn_web_development/Core/Scripting/Image_gallery\" rel=\"nofollow\">Image gallery</a> challenge, bringing its structure and delivery up-to-date and moving its position. I've put it after the <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Learn_web_development/Core/Scripting/DOM_scripting\" rel=\"nofollow\">DOM Scripting</a> article so it more accurately reflects what is tested in the updated challenge.</p>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n\n\n",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41296",
            "title": "Update image gallery challenge",
            "date_modified": "2025-09-28T23:41:53.000Z",
