            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11516302?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">remove <code class=\"notranslate\">text-autospace</code> from a list of properties not supported.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">text-autospace</code> is already supported by some browsers and is documented, so it should be removed from the list.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n\n\n",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41227",
            "title": "remove `text-autospace` from a list of properties not supported.",
            "date_modified": "2025-09-20T07:25:01.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-09-20T07:22:57.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "mfuji09",
